  <item>
    <title>“被导演”的强奸案</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a6604b7349f7a557207dab</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a6604b7349f7a557207dab</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 28 Jul 2024 15:14:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<ul><span>  </span><li><span>节目导语：</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>湖北鄂州农妇王丽珍连续两晚遭到陌生裸男入室侵犯，报警之后，警方设局为何却让受害人再被强奸？DNA鉴定结果揪出“凶手”，案件宣布告破，为啥镇上的村民们却不干了？一桩原本十分简单的案件，为何事发一年多都不能侦破？</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Timeline:</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="85">01:25</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="197">03:17</a>连续两晚遭到陌生男人入室侵犯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="198">03:18</a>:-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="402">06:42</a>报警之后警方设局“二次强奸”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="403">06:43</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="517">08:37</a>反复摸排好无头绪 DNA指向嫌犯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="518">08:38</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="635">10:35</a>警方破案 同村的人却为嫌犯连连叫冤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="636">10:36</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="764">12:44</a>嫌犯当庭翻供 DNA鉴定有问题？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="765">12:45</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="828">13:48</a>李端庆判无罪 案件又回到了起点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="829">13:49</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="970">16:10</a> DNA鉴定牵出“婚外情”？</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>涉及图片资料：</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr2vq7dK2MiseZ4orRFQdivlJGct.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>-王丽珍家 外部环境-</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoswaiUf3p7MgzfY-cZyWQgVt5iP.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>-王丽珍家 卧室-</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmnryUFCqcLPQz0Rx3sz9oyB3QZG.m4a" length="17339539" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:17:52</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkw030ceGaJXNqge98xOflEfeoZp.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>香港名媛烹尸案</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6676e077925b29cb90bee38b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6676e077925b29cb90bee38b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 22 Jun 2024 14:32:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>节目导语：</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家好！新人报道，请多指教！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们要给大家讲述的是一桩发生在中国香港地区的命案，2023年2月21日，香港名媛蔡天凤神秘失踪，因为一直联系不上妻子，22日凌晨，蔡天凤的丈夫Chris报警。在蔡天凤失踪3天后，警方终于发现了她，但却是一具不完整的尸体，现场甚至有用人体组织烹煮过的汤！</span></p><span></span><p><span>原本生活光鲜亮丽的蔡天凤，为何突然被拽进死亡的深渊？凶手一家竟是全员恶人？你见过潜伏在人性中的那条名字叫做“恶”的寄生虫吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>案件图片：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqvyVAGEdj8r6eUcIziBoig0OqRS.png"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>-警方在案发现场搜查到的作案工具</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpZbWNNLAk6qZwvvSo26tlhrBye2.png"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>-监控最后一次拍下蔡天凤的身影</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvudqabNVEa_ShElglIMpryzLRFh.png"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>-蔡天凤与时尚杂志合作</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmXEquptRqzPG-7UUeE7LSGz8gDu.png"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>-前夫邝港智与死者蔡天凤</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj5qKoA4htXLJrVmHmAym20E-4z0.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>-蔡天凤分尸案涉案成员</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhPG1y62TwgTE-faMkZMH9Kly4VX.png"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>-警方在香港国际机场附近的码头抓捕邝港智</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>Timeline:</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="85">01:25</a> 开场+新人介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="86">01:26</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="209">03:29</a> 香港名媛蔡天凤惨遭分尸 凶手竟将尸块做成汤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="348">05:48</a> 凶手露出马脚？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="349">05:49</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="444">07:24</a> 蔡天凤的感情生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="445">07:25</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="596">09:56</a> 上梁不正下梁歪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="597">09:57</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="707">11:47</a> 活在蔡天凤身上的寄生虫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="708">11:48</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="869">14:29</a> 善心资助反被夺命</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="870">14:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1061">17:41</a> 一切早有预谋？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1062">17:42</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1122">18:42</a> 规则和制度才能遏制人性的阴暗</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgwYN1hkn-1S_Q6BvGDLdj8Cy1j_.m4a" length="19705022" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:20:18</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkw030ceGaJXNqge98xOflEfeoZp.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
